      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_02",
      "hash64": "CA7C0710D7006017",
      "text": "Je confirme que c’est la première fois\\nqu’on vient ici.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_03",
      "hash64": "CA7C0610D7005E64",
      "text": "Comment ça « non » ? Nous trois, on a jamais\\nmis les pieds ici, en tout cas ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "A86DDEBE5C0FEAE6",
      "text": "Ho ho, je vois.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "A86DDDBE5C0FE933",
      "text": "Vous pourrez loger dans ce bâtiment pendant\\nvotre séjour.\\c\\nLes chambres sont prêtes et les draps\\nsont tout propres.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_03",
      "hash64": "8E4761E6A0AFCE0E",
      "text": "Ça alors, quel accueil !\\nVous avez pensé à tout ![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "A86DDCBE5C0FE780",
      "text": "Je suis ravi que cela vous plaise.\\nSur ce, passez un agréable séjour ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_04",
      "hash64": "6B6AAF96E5DDEDC5",
      "text": "Merci beaucoup, monsieur ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_04",
      "hash64": "CA7C0510D7005CB1",
      "text": "Au fait... T’as toujours pas reçu de nouvelles\\nde ton pote Kassis, là ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_04",
      "hash64": "8E4764E6A0AFD327",
      "text": "Il... il n’a pas de portable ?! Sérieusement ?!\\nÇa existe encore, des gens comme ça ?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_05",
      "hash64": "6B6AAE96E5DDEC12",
      "text": "C’est un anticonformiste ! Il me plaît déjà !\\nVous pensez qu’il est chez lui ? Et si on y allait ?\\c\\nSi Kassis ne vient pas à Menzi, Menzi ira à Kassis ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_npc",
      "hash64": "A4EB939C873C3800",
      "text": "On va voir qui de Kassis ou de moi mérite\\nle titre de « meilleur ami » ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_npc",
      "hash64": "152B81E1B3A5A5D2",
      "text": "On ne capte rien ici... Comment je vais faire pour\\nsurvivre sans réseau... ?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
